// CreateDeployment creates a deployment for a repository ref, such as a branch, tag, or commit SHA. Supply `ref` and configure the target `environment`, commit status checks, or deployment `payload` as needed; omitted settings use the documented defaults. A 202 response indicates that the default branch was merged into the requested ref instead of creating a deployment.
